!! MemeProvider — see docs/meme-provider

MemeProvider coalesces the fan-out between an Automerge DocHandle and typed projections: a per-URI
debounce at human-editing scale, one `onChangeset(union)` per bag above the threshold, and a keyed
storm gate whose `maxWaitMs` keeps an unbroken flood from starving re-projection. Sync-complete binds
per ISLAND, and bulk state lands before the completion fires.

''One room owns the source pointer'' — two rooms naming one file give a reader two places to check and
one place to go stale. The full statement lives at:

<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/docs/meme-provider#/law">>
